{"content":[{"c":["JEDAIAH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Shimri’s son and the father of Allon. He is listed in the genealogical tables of the Simeonites who settled in the valley of Gedor in Hezekiah’s time (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.4.37","r":"1Chr.4.37","rawR":"1Chr.4.37","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.4.37","value":"1Chr.4.37"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 4:37"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Harumaph’s son, who helped repair the Jerusalem wall after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.3.10","r":"Neh.3.10","rawR":"Neh.3.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.3.10","value":"Neh.3.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 3:10"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Aaron’s descendant and head of the second of the 24 priestly divisions for temple service in David’s time (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.24.7","r":"1Chr.24.7","rawR":"1Chr.24.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.24.7","value":"1Chr.24.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 24:7"},"). His descendants are listed among the returned exiles (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.9.10","r":"1Chr.9.10","rawR":"1Chr.9.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.9.10","value":"1Chr.9.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 9:10"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.2.36","r":"Ezra.2.36","rawR":"Ezra.2.36","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.2.36","value":"Ezra.2.36"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 2:36"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.7.39","r":"Neh.7.39","rawR":"Neh.7.39","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.7.39","value":"Neh.7.39"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 7:39"},"). The individuals and families listed below are probably a part of this priestly line, but their exact relationships are difficult to determine."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Provincial priest who agreed to resettle in postexilic Jerusalem (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.10","r":"Neh.11.10","rawR":"Neh.11.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.10","value":"Neh.11.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:10"},"; cf. v ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.2","r":"Neh.11.2","rawR":"Neh.11.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.2","value":"Neh.11.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"2"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. Priest who returned with Zerubbabel after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.12.6-7","r":"Neh.12.6-7","rawR":"Neh.12.6-7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.12.6-7","value":"Neh.12.6-7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 12:6-7"},"). In the next generation this was the name of a family (v ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.12.21","r":"Neh.12.21","rawR":"Neh.12.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.12.21","value":"Neh.12.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"21"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["6. One of the exiles taken by Zechariah as witness to the symbolic crowning of Joshua (",{"c":["nlt"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," “Jeshua”). He may be the same as #4 or #5 above. He came back from captivity bringing gifts for the temple in the days of the high priest Joshua (",{"href":"?bref=Zech.6.10-14","r":"Zech.6.10-14","rawR":"Zech.6.10-14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Zech.6.10-14","value":"Zech.6.10-14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Zec 6:10-14"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Jedaiah","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 4:37","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.4.37","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.4.37","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.4.37"},{"anchorText":"Neh 3:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.3.10","rawQueryValue":"Neh.3.10","sourceRefExact":"Neh.3.10"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 24:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.24.7","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.24.7","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.24.7"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 9:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.9.10","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.9.10","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.9.10"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 2:36","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.2.36","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.2.36","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.2.36"},{"anchorText":"Neh 7:39","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.7.39","rawQueryValue":"Neh.7.39","sourceRefExact":"Neh.7.39"},{"anchorText":"Neh 11:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.11.10","rawQueryValue":"Neh.11.10","sourceRefExact":"Neh.11.10"},{"anchorText":"2","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.11.2","rawQueryValue":"Neh.11.2","sourceRefExact":"Neh.11.2"},{"anchorText":"Neh 12:6-7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.12.6-7","rawQueryValue":"Neh.12.6-7","sourceRefExact":"Neh.12.6-7"},{"anchorText":"21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.12.21","rawQueryValue":"Neh.12.21","sourceRefExact":"Neh.12.21"},{"anchorText":"Zec 6:10-14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Zech.6.10-14","rawQueryValue":"Zech.6.10-14","sourceRefExact":"Zech.6.10-14"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"aacc75931d7de75e63f3eb1371fa296d1c4d15c3946ddd47bce2cfbf4ec74b18","sourceItemName":"Jedaiah","sourceItemOrder":128,"sourceMember":"Articles/J.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Jedaiah","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Jedaiah","title":"Jedaiah","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}